From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Wang <jimwan@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 15:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] sdm-backend: drop is_touch_only for weston 15

weston_surface::is_touch_only was removed in weston 15.  The
touch-only-surface Wayland extension handler that sets it is now a
no-op; the field simply no longer exists in the ABI.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Jim Wang <jimwan@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 sdm-backend/touch-only-surface.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sdm-backend/touch-only-surface.c b/sdm-backend/touch-only-surface.c
index abc1234..def5678 100644
--- a/sdm-backend/touch-only-surface.c
+++ b/sdm-backend/touch-only-surface.c
@@ -33,5 +33,4 @@ touch_only_surface_set_touch_only(struct wl_client *client,
		return;
	}

-	surface->is_touch_only = (enabled != 0);
 }

